# Ignore everything
*
!.gitignore

# Keep these top-level folders
!Assets/
!Packages/
!ProjectSettings/
!UserSettings/

# Allow everything inside those folders recursively
!Assets/**
!Packages/**
!ProjectSettings/**
!UserSettings/**

# But still exclude generated/junk inside Assets
# Third-party pack (large terrains/audio); keep local only — do not push to GitHub
Assets/BOKI/**
Assets/BOKI.meta
Assets/AssetStoreTools/
Assets/EmaceArt/
Assets/GuruGames - Fence Pack/
Assets/RPGPP_LT/
Assets/Stylized Fences 2
Assets/DavidJalbert/
Assets/Pandazole_Ultimate_Pack/
Assets/PBS Materials Variety Pack/
Assets/Stylized Brick Materials/

[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE folders (optional, personal preference)
.idea/
.vscode/
.cursor/
*.suo
*.user